@page "/service-terms"
@attribute [ExcludeFromInteractiveRouting]
<PageTitle>Service and billing details | Tide Casa</PageTitle>
<div class="bt-unified"><SiteHeader /><main class="bt-one-section bt-service-details"><p class="bt-one-kicker">SERVICE &amp; BILLING DETAILS</p><h1>Your app. Clear next steps.</h1><p class="bt-one-lead">Review your scope and charges before you pay. These details describe new Tide Casa and BarTide app plans; your billing panel keeps the terms of any earlier purchase.</p>
<section aria-labelledby="price-heading"><h2 id="price-heading">What you pay</h2><dl class="service-price-list"><div><dt>App setup, once</dt><dd>$600 USD</dd></div><div><dt>Maintenance, monthly</dt><dd>$50 USD</dd></div><div><dt>Initial payment, including the first month</dt><dd>$650 USD</dd></div><div><dt>Optional app-store package, once</dt><dd>+$300 USD</dd></div><div><dt>Initial payment with the app-store package</dt><dd>$950 USD</dd></div></dl><p>After the initial payment, maintenance is $50 each month until canceled. If an approved referral code applies a discount, you will see the exact adjustment before confirming checkout. Registering a workspace is free and does not start billing.</p></section>
<section id="maintenance" aria-labelledby="maintenance-heading"><h2 id="maintenance-heading">Maintenance &amp; cancellation</h2><p>The $50 monthly maintenance plan covers hosting, routine app upkeep and support for the agreed app. You have editing access for everyday changes to photos, descriptions, prices and hours. New features, custom integrations and outside-provider costs require a separate agreement.</p><p>The first month begins with your initial payment. Maintenance automatically renews monthly until canceled. Cancel renewal from the billing panel in your workspace before the next billing date; your plan continues through the paid period. The panel shows your renewal date, payment status and cancellation status.</p><p>Canceling renewal does not refund past payments. Contact us from your workspace or at <a href="mailto:hello@tide.casa">hello@tide.casa</a> to discuss a billing issue, refund request or service transition. We review these requests personally.</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="build-heading"><h2 id="build-heading">Build, review &amp; launch</h2><p>We agree on the app’s scope before payment. Verified initial payment starts the seven-calendar-day period for our team to build and review your app. You can share content in your private workspace throughout the process.</p><p>Your app stays private until the build period has passed and a person approves launch with you. The seven-day build period is not a promise of automatic publication or app-store approval.</p></section>
<section id="app-stores" aria-labelledby="stores-heading"><h2 id="stores-heading">Optional app-store package · $300 once</h2><p>This package adds preparation and submission support for eligible Apple App Store, Google Play and other supported stores agreed for your app. We review the app’s suitability, required features, listing materials and submission scope with you. The normal browser and home-screen app is included in the base service.</p><p>You own and manage the required developer accounts and approve each submission. Developer memberships, store fees and any separately agreed additional development are paid separately. Stores set their own eligibility, testing and review requirements and decide whether to approve an app. Availability in every store or approval by a particular date is not guaranteed.</p><p>App-store review takes place on its own timeline after the app is ready. We discuss any required changes with you before expanding the agreed work. See the <a href="https://developer.apple.com/app-store/review/guidelines/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple App Review Guidelines</a> and <a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9898783?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play functionality requirements</a>.</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="payments-heading"><h2 id="payments-heading">Your customers pay your business</h2><p>These fees pay for your Tide Casa or BarTide app service. Your customers’ restaurant orders or other purchases stay with your business. Optional payment, SMS and other outside providers may charge their own fees.</p></section>
<p><a class="bt-one-button" href="/start/restaurant">Create a free workspace</a></p><p><a class="bt-one-link" href="/book-a-demo">Talk through your app with us</a></p></main><SiteFooter /></div>
